{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>英偉達CEO黃仁勳近日向公司員工發出一封道歉信，承認自己對妻子不忠，並就此向家人、公司員工、董事會及股東公開道歉</strong>。黃仁勳在信中表示，自己的行為傷害了妻子和孩子，沒有任何藉口。他願意承擔全部責任，並希望能夠逐漸重新贏得家人和同事的信任。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585520.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.516451+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T23:21:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"57412add4aa95cde5aa176e0b71e358f216d58724e96849dc060960b8dc9806f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}